Recommends: gnome-shell
Description: Keyboard configuration + system-wide dark-mode orchestrator for GNOME
 Nightpanel is two tools in one. A theming orchestrator flips alacritty, tmux,
 nvim, emacs, GNOME (GTK CSS + background), Claude Code and Firefox into a
 coordinated dark palette with one click from a panel button or the CLI, and
 reverts to the pre-apply state on the next click. A keyboard configurator
 provides a videogame-like options UI to customize GNOME shortcuts, create
 profiles, apply curated presets and view an on-screen cheat sheet.
